    <h2 class="text-lg font-bold mt-4">About this RFC</h2>
    <h3 class="text-sm font-bold mt-2">Details</h3>
    <dl>
      
      <dt class="font-bold mt-2">Updated by (3)</dt><dd><a href="/info/rfc8252/" class="text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-500 dark:hover:text-blue-200 cursor-pointer underline">RFC 8252: OAuth 2.0 for Native Apps</a>, <a href="/info/rfc8996/" class="text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-500 dark:hover:text-blue-200 cursor-pointer underline">RFC 8996: Deprecating TLS 1.0 and TLS 1.1</a>, <a href="/info/rfc9700/" class="text-blue-300 dark:text-blue-100 hover:text-blue-500 dark:hover:text-blue-200 cursor-pointer underline">RFC 9700: Best Current Practice for OAuth 2.0 Security</a>.</dd>
